From: Ard Biesheuvel <ard.biesheuvel-QSEj5FYQhm4dnm+yROfE0A@public.gmane.org>
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] efi: add support for seeding the RNG from a UEFI config table
Date: Thu,  6 Oct 2016 11:27:25 +0100
Message-ID: <1475749646-10844-2-git-send-email-ard.biesheuvel@linaro.org>
References: <1475749646-10844-1-git-send-email-ard.biesheuvel@linaro.org>
